        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Cure</strong> is a realistic bodycam-style co-op survival horror game that will test your teamwork and nerves. Trapped deep within a dark, decaying hospital, you and your friends must search for the last remaining cure before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you’re not alone. Something hunts you—an unpredictable, relentless AI-driven enemy that reacts to your every move. Noise will betray you. Light might save you... or lead to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intense proximity voice chat, communication becomes both your greatest weapon and your biggest risk. Will you whisper for help… or scream in terror?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a short but heart-pounding experience inside an atmospheric environment filled with fear, tension, and a fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Survival Horror</strong> – Play with up to 4 players and face the nightmare together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Bodycam Graphics</strong> – Immersive, gritty visuals that make you feel truly there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable AI</strong> – The enemy learns, adapts, and hunts you in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the Cure</strong> – Search for the last hope for humanity before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> – Choose from 4 unique character skins.</p>",
